{
  "native_artifact_sha256": "44215f0ec21d13e993f11b5f4086b5840581c4a6a3c2f9ac584e2c423bcd00ee",
  "sdk_segments": [
    {
      "text": "And after.",
      "start_ms": 690,
      "end_ms": 1590,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 0,
      "token_end_index": 3
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah, that's an option too. Yeah, after dinner. Sure.",
      "start_ms": 1710,
      "end_ms": 5670,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 3,
      "token_end_index": 21
    },
    {
      "text": " Three is good, though. But yeah, whatever. What would you prefer?",
      "start_ms": 6090,
      "end_ms": 10170,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 21,
      "token_end_index": 45
    },
    {
      "text": " Or 3:30. I just—yeah.",
      "start_ms": 10230,
      "end_ms": 12990,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 45,
      "token_end_index": 56
    },
    {
      "text": " Well, it doesn't matter for me. I mean—",
      "start_ms": 13530,
      "end_ms": 14850,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 56,
      "token_end_index": 71
    },
    {
      "text": " Necessarily.",
      "start_ms": 14850,
      "end_ms": 15270,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 71,
      "token_end_index": 77
    },
    {
      "text": " 3:30 in the computer room in here, and then we can just go—",
      "start_ms": 15510,
      "end_ms": 18150,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 77,
      "token_end_index": 97
    },
    {
      "text": " Get in there, though.",
      "start_ms": 18210,
      "end_ms": 19050,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 97,
      "token_end_index": 106
    },
    {
      "text": " If you can't, can you get in the front door? Oh, you haven't got a key, do you? Can none of you get in there?",
      "start_ms": 19350,
      "end_ms": 23850,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 106,
      "token_end_index": 147
    },
    {
      "text": " Well, we can get in through the—",
      "start_ms": 23970,
      "end_ms": 25050,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 147,
      "token_end_index": 156
    },
    {
      "text": " Through the—",
      "start_ms": 25410,
      "end_ms": 25830,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 156,
      "token_end_index": 160
    },
    {
      "text": " The—this computer room's in here. The MSC computer lab.",
      "start_ms": 26010,
      "end_ms": 28950,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 160,
      "token_end_index": 180
    },
    {
      "text": " I've not found that yet.",
      "start_ms": 29010,
      "end_ms": 29730,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 180,
      "token_end_index": 188
    },
    {
      "text": " It's in here.",
      "start_ms": 29850,
      "end_ms": 30330,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 188,
      "token_end_index": 193
    },
    {
      "text": " How about if we take our—",
      "start_ms": 30330,
      "end_ms": 31050,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 193,
      "token_end_index": 202
    },
    {
      "text": " Or if you find me, I'll show you where— I'll let us all in there. We can look in there.",
      "start_ms": 31050,
      "end_ms": 35250,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 202,
      "token_end_index": 235
    },
    {
      "text": " We can look now, afterwards.",
      "start_ms": 35370,
      "end_ms": 36870,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 235,
      "token_end_index": 244
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah, yeah.",
      "start_ms": 37230,
      "end_ms": 37530,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 244,
      "token_end_index": 248
    },
    {
      "text": " You do need to have a key for it, though. That's the thing. You just can't unlock the wall, but—",
      "start_ms": 38010,
      "end_ms": 40950,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 248,
      "token_end_index": 281
    },
    {
      "text": " Okay. Just bang on it.",
      "start_ms": 40950,
      "end_ms": 42090,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 281,
      "token_end_index": 288
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah, somebody else—",
      "start_ms": 42270,
      "end_ms": 43050,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 288,
      "token_end_index": 296
    },
    {
      "text": " I was asking Steve about that, whether we can get in there. Whether he was going to get us access into there.",
      "start_ms": 43050,
      "end_ms": 47730,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 296,
      "token_end_index": 329
    },
    {
      "text": " Into what?",
      "start_ms": 48210,
      "end_ms": 48690,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 329,
      "token_end_index": 334
    },
    {
      "text": " The computer room.",
      "start_ms": 48810,
      "end_ms": 49350,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 334,
      "token_end_index": 339
    },
    {
      "text": " Okay.",
      "start_ms": 49590,
      "end_ms": 49770,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 339,
      "token_end_index": 341
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah. It's only got—it's crap. It's only got about 4 or 5 computers in, but it would do quite good for our job because it can all sit around. It's not very—not many people in it very often.",
      "start_ms": 50430,
      "end_ms": 57930,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 341,
      "token_end_index": 404
    },
    {
      "text": " Is there a printer in there too?",
      "start_ms": 58710,
      "end_ms": 59790,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 404,
      "token_end_index": 414
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah, there's a printer in there. And there's a photocopier with the code on it. Yeah, yeah.",
      "start_ms": 59850,
      "end_ms": 63930,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 414,
      "token_end_index": 445
    },
    {
      "text": " Really?",
      "start_ms": 64890,
      "end_ms": 65190,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 445,
      "token_end_index": 448
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah.",
      "start_ms": 65190,
      "end_ms": 65670,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 448,
      "token_end_index": 450
    },
    {
      "text": " Well, I've heard of a photocopier. I've heard of it.",
      "start_ms": 65730,
      "end_ms": 69930,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 450,
      "token_end_index": 473
    },
    {
      "text": " Assignment, if we want to.",
      "start_ms": 69990,
      "end_ms": 72090,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 473,
      "token_end_index": 483
    },
    {
      "text": " Got it on my computer.",
      "start_ms": 72690,
      "end_ms": 73710,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 483,
      "token_end_index": 490
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah.",
      "start_ms": 74130,
      "end_ms": 74250,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 490,
      "token_end_index": 492
    },
    {
      "text": " What are the comments? I'm thinking.",
      "start_ms": 74370,
      "end_ms": 75570,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 492,
      "token_end_index": 505
    },
    {
      "text": " So what time do we say? I just think it's better to do it afterwards than we have all the time in it.",
      "start_ms": 76110,
      "end_ms": 80850,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 505,
      "token_end_index": 536
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah, that's true.",
      "start_ms": 80910,
      "end_ms": 81330,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 536,
      "token_end_index": 543
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah, then have half an hour and then we'll—",
      "start_ms": 81630,
      "end_ms": 83250,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 543,
      "token_end_index": 558
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah.",
      "start_ms": 83310,
      "end_ms": 83490,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 558,
      "token_end_index": 560
    },
    {
      "text": " —actually run out.",
      "start_ms": 83550,
      "end_ms": 84270,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 560,
      "token_end_index": 567
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah.",
      "start_ms": 84450,
      "end_ms": 84630,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 567,
      "token_end_index": 569
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah. Okay.",
      "start_ms": 85410,
      "end_ms": 87690,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 569,
      "token_end_index": 573
    },
    {
      "text": " As long as DMLG doesn't go late.",
      "start_ms": 88830,
      "end_ms": 90450,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 573,
      "token_end_index": 586
    },
    {
      "text": " Hopefully it's not that, man. So it won't matter.",
      "start_ms": 91830,
      "end_ms": 93510,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 586,
      "token_end_index": 604
    },
    {
      "text": " Actually, it's not even confirmed yet.",
      "start_ms": 96330,
      "end_ms": 97950,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 604,
      "token_end_index": 617
    },
    {
      "text": " What?",
      "start_ms": 98790,
      "end_ms": 99030,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 617,
      "token_end_index": 620
    },
    {
      "text": " Oh.",
      "start_ms": 99210,
      "end_ms": 99390,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 620,
      "token_end_index": 622
    },
    {
      "text": " She doesn't even know what she's talking about yet. Maybe it doesn't happen at all.",
      "start_ms": 99690,
      "end_ms": 104130,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 622,
      "token_end_index": 651
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah, you know.",
      "start_ms": 104910,
      "end_ms": 105390,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 651,
      "token_end_index": 658
    },
    {
      "text": " Sounds like me.",
      "start_ms": 105390,
      "end_ms": 105870,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 658,
      "token_end_index": 664
    },
    {
      "text": " It's reading week next week. It should be. Shouldn't it be?",
      "start_ms": 105930,
      "end_ms": 108210,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 664,
      "token_end_index": 688
    },
    {
      "text": " Really?",
      "start_ms": 108330,
      "end_ms": 108990,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 688,
      "token_end_index": 691
    },
    {
      "text": " Well, it's supposed to be.",
      "start_ms": 109170,
      "end_ms": 110190,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 691,
      "token_end_index": 701
    },
    {
      "text": " It's reading weekend.",
      "start_ms": 110250,
      "end_ms": 111210,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 701,
      "token_end_index": 710
    },
    {
      "text": " Next week. It's week 6 next week.",
      "start_ms": 111270,
      "end_ms": 113190,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 710,
      "token_end_index": 723
    },
    {
      "text": " Reading?",
      "start_ms": 113310,
      "end_ms": 113850,
      "speaker": "3",
      "token_start_index": 723,
      "token_end_index": 726
    },
    {
      "text": " Oh.",
      "start_ms": 113910,
      "end_ms": 114090,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 726,
      "token_end_index": 728
    },
    {
      "text": " I don't think we have a reading week, though. I don't know. We have one class, at least, when we—like, speech perception. We don't have any.",
      "start_ms": 114150,
      "end_ms": 119550,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 728,
      "token_end_index": 775
    }
